Doctors, the shadow of the plague is gradually enveloping the entire city.To advance your development more efficiently and accelerate the fight against the epidemic, joining an alliance and fighting alongside fellow doctors is an excellent strategic choice.
An alliance is like a warm yet powerful family—
Here, you can fight side by side, support one another, share resources, grow and strengthen together, and unlock a wealth of exciting events.

**What You Gain by Joining an Alliance**
After joining an alliance, you will be able to:
•Collaborate with alliance members to complete a variety of quests;
•Join forces in battles and face enemies as a united front;
•Assist each other to speed up construction and hero cultivation progress;
•Share resources and vital intelligence;
•Chat in the alliance channel and meet like-minded allies.
Through alliance cooperation, your overall development speed and might growth will receive a massive boost.
